  "question": {
    "text": "The tangents at the extremities of the latus rectum of the ellipse <math><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math> form a rhombus <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math>. Area (in sq. units) of the rhombus <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math> outside the ellipse is equal to",
    "image": null
